# Outfit gear (R18): a press satchel at the left hip: a soft bag with a rounded bottom, the accent flap folded over the
# top and down the outer face with a steel buckle, the strap running up the side, a glowing press tag.
# The outer face is y 0 (the bag hangs on the left side).
name outfit_satchel
grid 5
size 7 4 15
slot bag SwatchMain
slot flap SwatchAccent
slot buckle Steel
slot tag SwatchGlow
box 0 1 1 7 4 6 bag
box 1 1 0 6 4 1 bag
box 0 0 2 7 1 6 bag
box 0 0 6 7 4 7 flap
box 0 0 3 7 1 6 flap
box 3 0 3 4 1 4 buckle
box 3 2 7 4 3 15 flap
box 5 0 1 6 1 2 tag
pivot 3 2 0
